        "kind": "concept",
        "headingEn": "The second conjugation and its signature 'и'",
        "en": "Most verbs ending in -ить belong to the second conjugation. To conjugate, drop the -ить ending to get the stem (говорить → говор-), then add the personal ending. The six endings are: я -ю, ты -ишь, он/она -ит, мы -им, вы -ите, они -ят. Notice the signature vowel here is 'и', not the 'е' of the first conjugation — that single vowel is how you tell the two groups apart."
