        "headingEn": "A two-step routine for any verb",
        "en": "To conjugate any regular A1 verb, follow two steps. STEP 1 — look at the infinitive ending: -ать/-ять means first conjugation (vowel 'е', они -ют); -ить means second conjugation (vowel 'и', они -ят). STEP 2 — drop the -ть, find the stem, and add the ending for your subject. Do these two steps and the right form falls out every time."
