      "objectiveEn": "Apply the spelling rule that after Ж, Ш, Ч, Щ and Г, К, Х you write -и- not -ы- (so plural is -ие, masculine is -ий), and choose -ий vs -ый and -ие vs -ые correctly for stems ending in these letters.",
