        "headingEn": "The word час changes after numbers",
        "en": "The word for 'hour/o'clock' changes its ending depending on the number before it. After 1: час (one o'clock). After 2, 3, 4: часа́. After 5–20: часо́в. This pattern follows the standard Russian number-counting rule."
