        "kind": "example",
        "headingEn": "Introducing the grandparents",
        "ru": "Это мой дедушка. Это моя бабушка.",
        "translit": "Eto moy dedushka. Eto moya babushka.",
        "en": "You can introduce two people in two short, calm sentences. There is no rush — each sentence stands on its own."
