        "headingEn": "A friendly rule of thumb",
        "ru": "мой сын, моя дочь",
        "translit": "moy syn, moya doch'",
        "en": "If the family word ends in the soft -a sound (мама, бабушка, внучка), reach for моя. Use мой with сын, внук, дедушка. (Папа is a friendly exception: it ends in -a but is a man, so мой папа.)"
