      "moduleId": "a2-dative",
      "index": 4,
      "titleEn": "Prepositions к and по + Нужно/Надо",
      "objectiveEn": "Use the dative-requiring prepositions к (toward/to a person) and по (along/by/about), and build necessity statements with мне нужно / надо.",
      "teach": [
       {
        "kind": "concept",
        "headingEn": "к + dative — motion toward a person/place",
        "en": "к (к/ко) means 'toward' or 'to (see) a person'. It always takes the dative. Use it for going to a person: Я иду к врачу (I'm going to the doctor), к другу (to a friend's place), к маме (to mom's). Before some consonant clusters it becomes ко: ко мне (to me/my place)."
       },
       {
        "kind": "concept",
        "headingEn": "по + dative — along / around / by / about",
        "en": "по + dative has several common meanings: movement along/around a surface (по улице — along the street, гулять по городу — walk around the city), means of communication (по телефону — by phone, по почте — by mail), and 'on the subject of' (учебник по математике — a maths textbook, экзамен по русскому языку)."
       },
       {
        "kind": "example",
        "ru": "Сегодня я иду к врачу.",
        "translit": "Segodnya ya idu k vrachu.",
        "en": "Today I'm going to the doctor. (к + dative: врач → врачу)"
       },
       {
        "kind": "example",
        "ru": "Мы гуляли по парку.",
        "translit": "My gulyali po parku.",
        "en": "We walked around the park. (по + dative: парк → парку)"
       },
       {
        "kind": "concept",
        "headingEn": "нужно / надо — necessity with the dative",
        "en": "To say someone needs to do something, use the dative person + нужно/надо + infinitive: Мне нужно работать (I need to work), Тебе надо отдохнуть (You need to rest). нужно and надо are interchangeable here (надо is a bit more colloquial). Past = было, future = будет: Мне нужно было идти / Мне нужно будет идти."
       },
       {
        "kind": "example",
        "ru": "Мне нужно купить хлеб.",
        "translit": "Mne nuzhno kupit' khleb.",
        "en": "I need to buy bread. (Мне = dative experiencer + нужно + infinitive)"
       },
       {
        "kind": "tip",
        "en": "With a NOUN (not an infinitive), нужен agrees with the thing needed: Мне нужен словарь (m.), Мне нужна книга (f.), Мне нужно время (n.), Мне нужны деньги (pl.). The person stays dative. The neuter нужно is also the form used with infinitives."
       }
      ],
