        "ru": "красивый → красивее",
        "translit": "krasívyy → krasíveye",
        "en": "beautiful → more beautiful",
        "noteEn": "Drop the adjective ending (-ый/-ий/-ой) and add -ее: красив- + -ее. Stress often shifts onto the ending in short words but stays on the stem in longer ones (краси́вее)."
