        "en": "These are the words you hear at stations, ticket counters, and on the street. Notice that вокзал (train station) and аптека (pharmacy) are stressed on the last syllable: vak-ZAL, ap-TYE-ka. Listen for whole phrases too, not just single words.",
        "ru": "вокзал, билет, аптека",
        "translit": "vak-ZAL, bee-LYET, ap-TYE-ka",
        "noteEn": "Russian has no word for 'the' or 'a' — билет just means '(a) ticket'."
