        "kind": "tip",
        "headingEn": "Two phrases you'll use constantly",
        "en": "'Где...?' means 'Where is...?' and 'Сколько стоит?' means 'How much does it cost?'. Train your ear to catch the question word at the start — it tells you what kind of answer is coming.",
