        "kind": "concept",
        "headingEn": "Duration expressions and aspect",
        "en": "Expressions of duration with the accusative — 'два часа', 'весь день', 'долго', 'целую неделю' — pair with the IMPERFECTIVE, because they measure an ongoing process: 'Я читал два часа'. By contrast, 'за' + accusative time ('за два часа' = within/in two hours) pairs with the PERFECTIVE and means the action was completed within that span: 'Я прочитал книгу за два часа'. Don't confuse 'два часа' (НСВ, duration) with 'за два часа' (СВ, completion time)."
