        "en": "Put the word that carries the focus of the question directly before ли. Usually this is the verb: «Ты придёшь?» → Он спросил, придёшь ли ты ('He asked whether you would come'). If the question focuses on another element, that element leads: «В Москве он живёт?» → Он спросил, в Москве ли он живёт. Pronouns and tense follow the same rules as statements (person shifts, tense stays)."
