        "translit": "Referat — eto obzor istochnikov po teme; esse — eto argumentirovannoe izlozhenie sobstvennoy tochki zreniya.",
        "en": "A 'реферат' is an analytical summary-survey of existing sources on a topic (closer to a report/review), while an 'эссе' is a short argumentative essay presenting the author's own reasoned position. ТРКИ-2 writing tasks frequently ask for an эссе with a clear thesis and arguments."
