        "en": "'Следовательно' (consequently/therefore) and 'таким образом' (thus/in this way) introduce a logical conclusion; 'поэтому' (therefore) is slightly more neutral. 'Тем не менее' (nevertheless) and 'однако' (however) signal contrast — essential for balanced argumentation."
