        "kind": "tip",
        "en": "Exam strategy: when a prefixed verb is unfamiliar, do not guess from English. Strip the prefix to find a root you know, recall the prefix's core spatial meaning, then choose the abstract extension that fits. До- almost always signals reaching a limit or finishing (дочитать = read to the end); вы- signals 'out' literally (выйти = go out) or 'achieve by effort' (выучить = learn thoroughly, 'master out')."
