        "en": "This phenomenon is practically unrealizable without significant investments. Decode неосуществимо: не- ('un-') + осуществ- (root from осуществить, 'to realize/carry out') + -им- (the '-able' suffix) + -о (short-form neuter) = 'un-realiz-able' = unrealizable. The pieces predict the meaning even if you never met the whole word."
