        "en": "Разговорный стиль is the register of informal spoken interaction among people who know each other. Its markers: (1) ellipsis and incomplete sentences ('Ты куда?' for 'Куда ты идёшь?'); (2) modal/discourse particles (ну, же, вот, -то, разве, неужели, ведь); (3) diminutive and expressive suffixes (кофеёк, минуточка, домик, ручонки); (4) colloquial lexicon and intensifiers (классно, ужасно интересно, страшно рад); and (5) free word order and interjections. It is correct, living Russian — just inappropriate in formal writing."
