        "en": "'When the last peals of thunder had died away, when the rain had given way to a sparse dripping, and when the sun had timidly peeped from behind the clouds — only then did the village seem to come to from its torpor.' Three parallel «когда»-clauses build the rise; the dash and «только тогда» deliver the resolving fall."
