        "headingEn": "Publicistic style: standard vs. expression",
        "en": "Публицистический стиль lives on a permanent tension between стандарт and экспрессия. It needs ready clichés for rapid mass communication (как стало известно, по данным источников, ситуация остаётся напряжённой) yet constantly seeks fresh expressivity to grab attention — rhetorical questions, antithesis, irony, metaphor, evaluative epithets (вопиющий, беспрецедентный), and inclusive 'мы' that builds civic solidarity. Its dominant function is воздействие (influence) fused with informing. Watch for open авторская оценка — the publicist, unlike the scholar or clerk, openly takes sides."
