        "en": "Advanced cohesion replaces clumsy repetition with refined pro-forms. Данный ('the said / this given') points back formally to a just-mentioned noun (данный вопрос = 'this matter'). Таковой ('such / the same') is a bookish substitute for a previously named thing. Последний / первый ('the latter / the former') disambiguate two prior referents. Подобный and такого рода substitute for a kind of thing without naming it again."
