        "kind": "concept",
        "headingEn": "-то — vague specificity and gentle contrast",
        "en": "The hyphenated postfix -то has two main roles. On indefinite pronouns/adverbs (кто-то, что-то, где-то, как-то) it means 'some specific but unknown/unspecified one' — distinct from -нибудь ('any whatsoever'). On ordinary words it adds a soft contrastive or topicalising emphasis: 'Я-то знаю' ('I, for one, do know'), 'Работа-то есть, да платят мало' ('There IS work — it's just badly paid'), often setting up an implicit 'but'."
