        "kind": "concept",
        "headingEn": "Where they are blocked or optional",
        "en": "Collective numerals are NOT used with female persons (you must say три женщины, not трое женщин), nor with most inanimate count nouns (три стола, not трое столов). With mixed-gender groups and with the noun люди/человек they are common (нас семеро). They decline like plural adjectives: двое→двоих→двоим→двоими, and in oblique cases often yield to the cardinal (с двумя детьми is preferred over с двоими детьми)."
