        "en": "A formal letter follows a fixed skeleton: the salutation (обращение) «Уважаемый Иван Петрович!» — note that it ends with an exclamation mark and the name+patronymic, not a comma; an opening that states the reason or reference («Обращаемся к Вам по вопросу...», «В ответ на Ваше письмо от...»); the body, where the actual request, offer, or notice is set out with the standard clichés; and the closing formula «С уважением,» followed by the sender's name, position, and signature. The capitalized «Вы/Вас/Ваш» throughout signals respect to a single addressee."
