        "kind": "tip",
        "en": "Prefixes create distinct Aktionsarten: за- often = begin (запеть, to burst into song); по- = do a bit / for a while (погулять, to take a stroll); из-/-ся = exhaust by doing (изголодаться, to grow starved); до-...-ся = bring oneself to a bad end (доиграться). Picking the right prefix is half of sounding native."
