        "en": "The C2 speaking subtest tests two distinct competences. The МОНОЛОГ (often монолог-рассуждение — a reasoned monologue) requires you to develop a thesis, support it with arguments and examples, anticipate objections and conclude — all unscripted and coherently structured. The ДИСКУССИЯ / диалог requires interactive management: stating and defending a position, conceding partially (частичное согласие), countering politely, and steering the exchange. Fluency alone is not enough; the examiner assesses argument structure and pragmatic appropriateness."
