        "translit": "Monológ-rassuzhdénie: «Kazálos' by, otvét ochevíden. Odnáko, ésli prismotrét'sya, kartína okázyvaetsya kudá slozhnée. Rassmótrim tri argumenta…»",
        "en": "Reasoned monologue: 'One would think the answer is obvious. However, on closer inspection, the picture turns out far more complex. Let us consider three arguments…' (A strong opening sets up a thesis, signals nuance, and announces structure.)"
