        "en": "An archaism (архаизм) is a word that has fallen out of everyday use but names something that still exists, because a newer synonym replaced it. The referent persists; only the label is obsolete. Thus око → глаз (eye), чело → лоб (forehead), уста → губы/рот (lips/mouth), длань → ладонь (palm), выя → шея (neck), ланиты → щёки (cheeks). Using an archaism today is a deliberate stylistic choice — solemn, poetic, or ironic — never neutral."
