        "en": "Метафора is a transfer of meaning (перенос значения) based on a hidden likeness between two things, WITHOUT the comparison markers как, словно, будто. Where a simile (сравнение) says 'the eyes are LIKE stars', a metaphor fuses them: 'звёзды глаз' ('the stars of [her] eyes'). At C2 you must not merely spot a metaphor but name the donor and target domains and the feature transferred — what quality migrates from source to target, and to what expressive end."
