        "en": "Four neighbours are routinely confused. ЭПИТЕТ is a figurative, evaluative modifier (золотая осень, немой укор). ОЛИЦЕТВОРЕНИЕ (personification) grants the animate to the inanimate (вьюга злится, 'the blizzard is angry'). СРАВНЕНИЕ keeps the two terms separate and marked by как/словно/будто/подобно. РАЗВЁРНУТАЯ МЕТАФОРА (extended metaphor) sustains one image across several lines, each new word elaborating the same transfer. Test: if the comparison word is present → simile; if a non-living thing acts as living → personification; if one thing is renamed AS another → metaphor."
